  "body": "The HTMLElement.focus() method has defined FocusOptions: preventScroll, focusVisible and maybe more in future.\r\nIs it possible to add a new property in FocusEvent to get the options?\r\n\r\nA possible example:\r\nUsing custom focus scroll behavior such as scrollIntoViewIfNeeded.\r\nI need to get the preventScroll to decide whether to execute custom scroll.",
